    "title": "Circle K Charge USA",
    "description": "Circle K makes it easy to be an EV driver, so you can take it easy while on the road. Download our mobile app, register as a driver and use our network of quick chargers while enjoying our convenience offer in one of our many stores. You will find all our Circle K charging stations in the app and can easily check which ones are available and have the right connector for your car. The app can be used to start/stop charging and to administer your profile, viewing charging history, download receipts and more.\r\n\r\nThis is the first release of the app that can be used on Circle K chargers in USA. We are continuously working with improvements and new smart features that will make it easy to be an EV driver. To read more, visit www.circlek.com/ev Welcome to visit our Circle K charging stations!",
